# 출품 검토 문서는 감사 기록이므로 보존하고, 원본 다운로드와 생성 빌드는 제외한다.
!/harness_docs/
harness_docs/*
!harness_docs/release/
!harness_docs/release/**
!harness_docs/qa/
!harness_docs/qa/validation_results.md
!harness_docs/design/
!harness_docs/design/**
!harness_docs/prompts/
/harness_docs/prompts/*
!/harness_docs/prompts/prompt_history.md
!harness_docs/dev-wiki/
harness_docs/dev-wiki/*
!harness_docs/dev-wiki/log.md

# 제출 보고서: 소스·재생성 도구·최종 PDF만 추적하고 렌더 중간물은 제외한다.
/report/*
!/report/game_introduction.md
!/report/ai_technical_report.md
!/report/portfolio.md
!/report/demo_playback_manifest.json
!/report/demo_bouncy_01_actions.json
!/report/tools/
/report/tools/*
!/report/tools/build_submission_reports_docx.py
!/report/tools/build_submission_reports_pptx.mjs
!/report/tools/build_final_report_docx.py
!/report/tools/finalize_submission_pdf.py
!/report/tools/record_gameplay_frames.py
!/report/tools/encode_png_frames.swift
!/report/tools/extract_video_frames.swift
!/report/tools/compose_gameplay_demo_frames.py
!/report/tools/capture_latest_pages.py
!/report/tools/verify_demo_pipeline.py
!/report/tools/verify_demo_video.swift
!/report/tools/record_latest_gameplay.py
!/report/tools/verify_demo_scene_sources.py
!/report/dist/
/report/dist/*
!/report/dist/property_shot_game_guide.pdf
!/report/dist/property_shot_ai_technical_report.pdf
!/report/dist/property_shot_portfolio.pdf

